WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.550
- So can you tell me a time

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.740
that you showed leadership skills?

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:05.730
- Yes, of course.

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:06.720
In my previous job

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.900
I took the initiative to
expand our clientele to Asia.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.370
Built my own biz devs sub-team

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:14.220
which allowed us to double
our revenue within six months.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.423
- Great. That's awesome.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:18.300
Now tell it again,

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.800
but in reverse.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.633
- Wait, what? Why?

00:00:20.633 --> 00:00:22.020
What does that have to do--

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.610
- You never reversed a story before?

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:27.270
I mean, it's a pretty
standard interview question.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.260
- Yeah. I, I mean, I

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.940
I really don't understand
how that's related

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.710
to my job or how that's related

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.960
to the day to day work that I'd be doing.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.040
All right, fuck it.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.000
Okay.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Six months within revenue
doubled built my sub-team,

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:44.100
expanded clientele to Asia.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.003
I took initiative.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.430
- Great. Yeah.

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:49.350
Now say it again,

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:52.833
but more efficiently,
using only five words.

00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:55.560
(intense music playing)

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:59.073
- Revenue, double, Asia, initiative.

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:01.170
The.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:03.810
- Awesome. Yeah. No, that's a good start.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:06.510
But do you think you can do better?

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:08.970
Do you think the way
you told your story was

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:10.743
the most optimal?

00:01:10.743 --> 00:01:12.570
(intense music playing)

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:15.810
Can you do it without
saying a single word?

00:01:18.351 --> 00:01:19.752
Ah, ah, ah.

00:01:19.752 --> 00:01:22.080
Not a single word.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:24.135
Think about your word efficiency.

00:01:24.135 --> 00:01:27.468
(intense music playing)

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:33.960
- Great.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:36.000
That's exactly what I was looking for.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:36.850
You got it right!

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:39.690
But,

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:41.010
but,

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:41.843
you didn't really

00:01:41.843 --> 00:01:45.840
explain your process and how
you came up with your answer.

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:50.840
So unfortunately, you won't be
proceeding to the next round.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.000
Yeah. But, but, but
thanks for coming though

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.713
I really appreciate it.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:58.613
- What the fuck?

